# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) for local development, and set the same
# variable on Netlify under Site configuration -> Environment variables.

# Web3Forms access key. Get one in a minute at https://web3forms.com by
# entering heartofart83@gmail.com — they email the key back, no account.
#
# The key is bound at their end to that one address, so it is safe in the
# built page the way a Firebase key is: whoever copies it can only cause
# mail to be sent TO you. It cannot read submissions or change where they go.
#
# Leave it unset and enquiries fall back to the visitor's own mail app.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
